## Batch 2 — Edit / Update / Export / Import
**Script:** `npm run test:cms:batch2` | headed: `npm run test:cms:batch2:headed`
**Workers:** 20 shared pool (all 220 flows in one queue — idle workers pick up next flow instantly)
**Estimated time:** ~29 min
**GHA:** `cms-batch2-scheduled.yml` — auto-triggers via `workflow_run` after Batch 1 completes

**Skips (via `--grep-invert` anchored with `$`):**
- All 21 Batch 1 flows (already executed)
- All delete flows

**220 flows across 20 modules (CRUD order within each module):**

