## GHA Daily Chain
```
5:00 AM IST
  └─ cms-batch1-trigger.yml fires repository_dispatch
       └─ cms-batch1-scheduled.yml (Batch 1, ~15 min)
            └─ workflow_run: completed → cms-batch2-scheduled.yml (Batch 2, ~29 min)
                 └─ workflow_run: completed → cms-batch3-scheduled.yml (Batch 3, ~32 min)
```

## Local Run (manual sequence)
```bash
npm run test:cms:batch1        # wait for completion, then:
npm run test:cms:batch2        # wait for completion, then:
npm run test:cms:batch3

# Headed (visible browser):
npm run test:cms:batch1:headed
npm run test:cms:batch2:headed
npm run test:cms:batch3:headed
```

## Stack
`core/navigation.ts selectStack()` tries `DEFAULT_STACK` (5s probe), falls back to `PriyalDocsStack`.

## Key settings (same for headless and headed)
- `PW_FLOW_MAX_MINUTES=5` per flow
- `PW_ACTION_TIMEOUT_MINUTES=3` (element timeout — fail step if stuck >3 min)
- `PW_SLOWMO=0`
- Docker image (GHA): `mcr.microsoft.com/playwright:v1.58.0-jammy`
- `PLAYWRIGHT_SKIP_BROWSER_DOWNLOAD=1` (browsers pre-installed in Docker)
